  "title": "Clootie Dumpling",
  "description": "This boiled dumpling is made with suet, currants and raisins and spiced with mixed spice and a hint of molasses. &#39;Clootie&#39; comes from the Scottish for &#39;little cloth&#39;.",
  "authors": [
    "Jill Barrett"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
